sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant OS as Android MediaSession/Settings
  participant App as DashCueSyncBridge
  participant BLE as Android BLE manager
  participant HUD as Firmware protocol/UI
  User->>OS: Playback or settings change
  OS->>App: StateFlow update
  App->>BLE: MEDIA_STATE or SETTINGS_SET
  BLE->>HUD: Serialized GATT fragments
  HUD->>HUD: Reassemble, CRC validate, decode and update state
  HUD-->>BLE: SETTINGS_STATE or command result when applicable
  BLE-->>App: Notification fragments
  Note over OS,HUD: Artwork metadata may exist, but Android bridge sends no artwork frames
